invariant: INV-5
file: x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: x509_pem_integer_to_bytes stops refusing an INTEGER whose first
  octet has its top bit set, a negative value. test_written writes such a
  qinv, which the ladder never reads.

--- old
    uint32_t bad = first >> 7;
--- new
    uint32_t bad = 0;
